{"path":"about.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--earth:#7b5e3b;--sand:#e9d6be;--leaf:#6a8f5a;--ink:#2b2a29;--muted:#8b7e74}
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial; color:var(--ink);background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--sand) 0%, #f6efe6 100%);}
    .page{max-width:980px;margin:32px auto;padding:28px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);border-radius:12px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--earth),var(--leaf));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin-left:14px;color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    h1{margin:18px 0 6px;font-size:28px}
    .lede{color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:18px}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:22px}
    .card{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);padding:18px;border-radius:10px}
    .values{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    .value{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}
    .dot{width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--earth);margin-top:6px}
    footer{margin-top:20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
    .cta{background:var(--earth);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none}
    small{color:var(--muted)}
    .pattern{position:absolute;right:-120px;top:-80px;opacity:0.12}
    /* Modal/trial button */
    .try-btn{background:transparent;border:2px solid var(--leaf);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;color:var(--leaf);cursor:pointer}
    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}
    /* Accessibility */
    .sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page" role="document">
    <svg class="pattern" width="420" height="420" viewBox="0 0 420 420" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
      <defs>
        <pattern id="p1" x="0" y="0" width="40" height="40" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
          <rect width="40" height="40" fill="#fff" />
          <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="6" fill="#e9d6be" />
          <path d="M0 40 L40 0" stroke="#7b5e3b" stroke-opacity="0.06"/>
        </pattern>
      </defs>
      <rect width="420" height="420" fill="url(#p1)" rx="40"/>
    </svg>

    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo" aria-hidden>SB</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="events.html">Gatherings</a>
        <a href="private-sessions.html">Private</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Rates</a>
        <a href="faq.html">Questions</a>
        <a href="book.html" class="cta">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <h1>About the practice room</h1>
      <p class="lede">We host compact, focused sound experiences designed to help you rest, set an intention, and return to daily life with a little more ease. Sessions are rooted in acoustic tone, gentle pacing, and guided moments of breath and attention.</p>

      <div class="grid">
        <div>
          <div class="card">
            <h2 style="margin-top:0">Our approach</h2>
            <p style="margin:0 0 10px">We blend tuned bowls, subtle percussion, and guided contemplative prompts. Each gathering lasts between 45 and 80 minutes and emphasizes clarity of presence over elaborate ritual.</p>
            <div class="values">
              <div class="value"><div class="dot" style="background:var(--earth)"></div><div><strong>Focused windows.</strong> Practical sessions that fit into modern life.</div></div>
              <div class="value"><div class="dot" style="background:var(--leaf)"></div><div><strong>Clear guidance.</strong> Simple instructions before and during sound to anchor attention.</div></div>
              <div class="value"><div class="dot" style="background:#c6a57c"></div><div><strong>Gentle design.</strong> Acoustic arrangements with sensitivity to ear-health and comfort.</div></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card" style="margin-top:14px">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0">A note on safety</h3>
            <p style="margin:0 0 8px">Contraindications: if you have epilepsy, a history of seizures, a pacemaker or implanted medical device, recent head or ear surgery, are presently pregnant, or have any condition for which sound exposure may be unsafe, please consult your physician before attending. If in doubt, reach out at {{EMAIL}} or call {{PHONE}}.</p>
            <p class="meta">We keep volumes and tempos gentle. If you feel uncomfortable during a session, you are welcome to step out at any time.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside>
          <div class="card">
            <h4 style="margin-top:0">Quick facts</h4>
            <ul style="padding-left:18px;margin:8px 0 0">
              <li>Sessions: small group (6–18 people)</li>
              <li>Typical length: 60 minutes</li>
              <li>Location: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</li>
            </ul>
            <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px">
              <button class="try-btn" id="open-trial">Try a brief practice</button>
              <a href="book.html" class="cta" style="text-decoration:none;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;">Reserve a seat</a>
            </div>
            <p class="meta" style="margin-top:10px">Questions before you come? Email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a> or call {{PHONE}}.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="card" style="margin-top:12px">
            <h4 style="margin-top:0">Host</h4>
            <p style="margin:0">Lead facilitator: a practitioner of tuned percussion and contemplative instruction. Work experience across clinical-adjacent settings and community teaching.</p>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>

    </main>

    <footer>
      <small>&copy; <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Contact: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></small>
      <div>
        <a href="contact.html">Reach us</a>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <!-- Guided trial modal -->
  <div id="trial-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-hidden="true" style="position:fixed;inset:0;display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:rgba(10,10,10,0.45);">
    <div style="width:94%;max-width:680px;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:20px;box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0">Try a short practice</h3>
      <p style="color:var(--muted)">Choose below: a breathing rhythm, a journaling prompt, or a one-minute intention set.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin:10px 0 14px">
        <button data-mode="breath" class="try-btn" style="border-color:var(--earth);color:var(--earth)">Breathing</button>
        <button data-mode="journ" class="try-btn" style="border-color:var(--leaf);color:var(--leaf)">Journaling</button>
        <button data-mode="intent" class="try-btn" style="border-color:#c49a6c;color:#c49a6c">Set intention</button>
        <button id="close-trial" style="margin-left:auto;background:transparent;border:0;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer">Close</button>
      </div>
      <div id="trial-area" style="min-height:120px"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // footer year
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

    // Modal logic
    const modal = document.getElementById('trial-modal');
    const open = document.getElementById('open-trial');
    const close = document.getElementById('close-trial');
    const area = document.getElementById('trial-area');

    open.addEventListener('click', ()=>{ modal.style.display='flex'; modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false'); area.innerHTML=''; });
    close.addEventListener('click', ()=>{ modal.style.display='none'; modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true'); });

    modal.addEventListener('click', (e)=>{ if(e.target===modal) { modal.style.display='none'; modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true'); } });

    function breathGuide(container){
      container.innerHTML = '<div style="font-size:18px;margin-bottom:8px">Focus: 4-6-8 breathing (2 rounds)</div><div id="pulse" style="height:90px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><div style="width:60px;height:60px;border-radius:50%;background:#f0e7dd;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--earth);font-weight:700">3</div></div>';
      let step = 0; const phases = [4,6,8]; let count=2; const el = container.querySelector('div div');
      const tick = ()=>{
        if(step>=phases.length){ step=0; count--; if(count<0) return; }
        el.textContent = phases[step];
        // animate scale
        el.style.transform='scale(1)';
        setTimeout(()=>el.style.transform='scale(0.6)', phases[step]*80);
        step++;
        setTimeout(tick, phases[step-1]*1000 + 300);
      };
      tick();
    }

    function journGuide(container){
      container.innerHTML = '<div style="font-size:18px;margin-bottom:8px">A short journaling prompt</div><textarea id="micro-journal" style="width:100%;height:110px;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #eee;resize:none;"></textarea><div style="margin-top:8px;display:flex;justify-content:flex-end"><button id="save-note" class="try-btn">Done</button></div>';
      document.getElementById('save-note').addEventListener('click', ()=>{ const v = document.getElementById('micro-journal').value; area.innerHTML = '<div style="color:var(--muted)">Saved locally for this tab. You wrote:</div><pre style="white-space:pre-wrap;background:#f7f3ee;padding:10px;border-radius:6px;margin-top:8px">'+(v||'<em>no text</em>')+'</pre>'; });
    }

    function intentGuide(container){
      container.innerHTML = '<div style="font-size:18px;margin-bottom:8px">One-minute intention set</div><div id="countdown" style="font-size:36px;color:var(--earth);font-weight:700">60</div><div style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">Sit upright, take soft breaths, and repeat quietly: "I let attention return when I wander."</div>';
      let t=60; const cd = setInterval(()=>{ t--; const el = document.getElementById('countdown'); if(!el){ clearInterval(cd); return; } el.textContent = t; if(t<=0) clearInterval(cd); }, 1000);
    }

    document.querySelectorAll('[data-mode]').forEach(btn=>{
      btn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        const mode = btn.getAttribute('data-mode');
        if(mode==='breath') breathGuide(area);
        if(mode==='journ') journGuide(area);
        if(mode==='intent') intentGuide(area);
      });
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"faq.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Questions — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--earth:#7b5e3b;--sand:#efe3cf;--leaf:#6a8f5a;--ink:#2b2a29;--muted:#7f746b}
    body{font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Arial;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--sand),#fff);color:var(--ink)}
    .wrap{max-width:980px;margin:36px auto;padding:22px}
    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
    nav a{margin-left:12px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
    .hero{background:#fff;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);}
    .cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:18px;margin-top:18px}
    .faq-item{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);padding:14px;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:10px}
    .question{font-weight:700}
    .answer{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}
    .cta{background:var(--earth);color:white;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    button.try{background:transparent;border:2px solid var(--leaf);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;color:var(--leaf);cursor:pointer}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center">
        <div style="width:56px;height:56px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--earth),var(--leaf));border-radius:10px;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700">SB</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="events.html">Gatherings</a>
        <a href="book.html" class="cta">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
      <h1 style="margin:6px 0">Frequently asked — practical answers</h1>
      <p class="small">Short, direct info to help you decide if a session is right for you. For other questions, contact <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a> or call {{PHONE}}.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="cols">
      <div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="question">What should I bring?</div>
          <div class="answer">Bring a cushion or mat, a blanket for warmth, and a water bottle. If you use hearing aids or have specific ear sensitivity, please let us know when you book.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="question">How loud will it be?</div>
          <div class="answer">Volumes are kept moderate and mindful. We avoid sharp peaks and prioritize a comfortable listening level. If you prefer lower volume, speak with the host upon arrival.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="question">Are these meditations?</div>
          <div class="answer">Sessions include guided prompts and breath cues, but they are not a formal meditation course. Think of them as structured listening windows with simple guidance to anchor attention.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="question">Is there an age limit?</div>
          <div class="answer">We recommend attendees be 16+. Children under 16 require parent supervision and prior arrangement.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="question">Refunds and transfers</div>
          <div class="answer">Full refund or transfer available up to 48 hours before an event. Within 48 hours, credit may be issued at our discretion.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="question">Contraindications</div>
          <div class="answer">If you have epilepsy, a pacemaker, cochlear implant, recent ear/head surgery, are pregnant, or have a condition sensitive to vibration or sound exposure, consult your healthcare provider before attending. We can recommend alternatives; reach us at {{EMAIL}}.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside>
        <div style="background:#fff;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.06)">
          <h4 style="margin-top:0">Try a micro-practice</h4>
          <p class="small">A short guided prompt to sample what we do. Runs locally in your browser.</p>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
            <button class="try" id="open-trial">Try it now</button>
            <a href="book.html" class="cta" style="text-decoration:none;display:inline-flex;align-items:center">Reserve</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:12px;background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.06)">
          <h5 style="margin-top:0">Quick contact</h5>
          <p class="small">Questions? <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a><br>Call: {{PHONE}}</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Trial modal (same widget) -->
  <div id="trial-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-hidden="true" style="position:fixed;inset:0;display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:rgba(10,10,10,0.45);">
    <div style="width:94%;max-width:680px;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:20px;box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0">A short sampler</h3>
      <p style="color:var(--muted)">Select a prompt to run in this window.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin:12px 0 16px">
        <button data-mode="breath" class="try">Breathing</button>
        <button data-mode="journ" class="try">Journaling</button>
        <button data-mode="intent" class="try">Set intention</button>
        <button id="close-trial" style="margin-left:auto;background:transparent;border:0;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer">Close</button>
      </div>
      <div id="trial-area" style="min-height:120px"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Modal reuse
    const modal = document.getElementById('trial-modal');
    const open = document.getElementById('open-trial');
    const close = document.getElementById('close-trial');
    const area = document.getElementById('trial-area');

    open.addEventListener('click', ()=>{ modal.style.display='flex'; modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false'); area.innerHTML=''; });
    close.addEventListener('click', ()=>{ modal.style.display='none'; modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true'); });
    modal.addEventListener('click', (e)=>{ if(e.target===modal) { modal.style.display='none'; modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true'); } });

    function breath(container){
      container.innerHTML='<div style="font-size:18px;margin-bottom:8px">Slow inhale — hold — long exhale</div><div id="dot" style="width:86px;height:86px;border-radius:50%;background:#f5efe6;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:var(--earth);margin:auto">3</div>';
      let seq=[4,3,6]; let i=0, rounds=2;
      const el = container.querySelector('#dot');
      const loop = ()=>{
        if(rounds<=0) return; el.textContent = seq[i]; el.style.transform='scale(1)'; setTimeout(()=>el.style.transform='scale(0.7)', seq[i]*80); i++; if(i>=seq.length){ i=0; rounds--; }
        if(rounds>0) setTimeout(loop, seq[(i?i-1:seq.length-1)]*1000 + 300);
      };
      loop();
    }

    function journ(container){
      container.innerHTML='<div style="font-size:18px;margin-bottom:8px">Prompt: Where do I need clarity today?</div><textarea style="width:100%;height:120px;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #eee"></textarea><div style="display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:8px"><button id="save" class="try">Save</button></div>';
      container.querySelector('#save').addEventListener('click', ()=>{ alert('Saved to this browser tab'); });
    }

    function intent(container){
      container.innerHTML='<div style="font-size:18px;margin-bottom:8px">Set a short intention</div><input placeholder="I intend to..." style="width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #eee"/><div style="display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:8px"><button id="ok" class="try">Set</button></div>';
      container.querySelector('#ok').addEventListener('click', ()=>{ alert('Intention set for this session'); });
    }

    document.querySelectorAll('[data-mode]').forEach(btn=>{
      btn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        const m = btn.getAttribute('data-mode'); if(m==='breath') breath(area); if(m==='journ') journ(area); if(m==='intent') intent(area);
      });
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"book.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Reserve — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--earth:#7b5e3b;--sand:#efe3cf;--leaf:#6a8f5a;--ink:#2b2a29;--muted:#7f746b}
    body{font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Arial;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,var(--sand));color:var(--ink)}
    .container{max-width:980px;margin:32px auto;padding:20px}
    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
    nav a{margin-left:12px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
    .panel{background:#fff;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:18px;margin-top:18px}
    label{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-weight:600}
    input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #eee}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .btn{background:var(--earth);color:#fff;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:0;cursor:pointer}
    .seat-control{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}
    .seat-num{font-size:20px;font-weight:700}
    .packing{background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px}
    .note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center">
        <div style="width:56px;height:56px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--earth),var(--leaf));border-radius:10px;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700">SB</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="events.html">Gatherings</a>
        <a href="faq.html">Questions</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="panel">
      <h1 style="margin-top:6px">Reserve your spot</h1>
      <p class="muted">Select an upcoming event and choose seats. Packing suggestions will update based on your selections.</p>

      <div class="grid">
        <section>
          <form id="booking-form" onsubmit="return false;">
            <label for="event">Next event</label>
            <select id="event" aria-label="Choose an event">
              <option value="2026-03-05">Mar 5, 2026 — Evening Clearing (6:30pm)</option>
              <option value="2026-03-12">Mar 12, 2026 — Midday Pause (12:00pm)</option>
              <option value="2026-03-20">Mar 20, 2026 — New Cycle Mini (8:00am)</option>
            </select>

            <div style="margin-top:12px">
              <label>Seats</label>
              <div class="seat-control">
                <button id="dec" style="padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #eee">-</button>
                <div class="seat-num" id="seat-count">1</div>
                <button id="inc" style="padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #eee">+</button>
                <div class="muted" id="seats-available" style="margin-left:10px">Available: <span id="avail">12</span></div>
              </div>
              <div class="note" style="margin-top:6px">This is a local selector only; inventory is illustrative.</div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:12px">
              <label for="name">Your name</label>
              <input id="name" placeholder="Full name" required>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:12px">
              <label for="email">Email</label>
              <input id="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:12px">
              <button id="book-now" class="btn">Confirm reservation</button>
            </div>

